 "method": "CPU-free, from committed captures only.  Compared: the MissionLoad entry snapshot, the MissionLoad final state, allocation records, the ordered MissionLoad binding log, startup binding counts, and for load_tail / between_frames / frame1 the state after the phase, the per-routine entry trace, the declared boundaries, the Windows answers and the binding names in order.  A differing state dword is classified ``backend_address`` only when both values lie inside the two backends' declared object/surface regions (0x3600000..0x3610000, 0x60000000..0x60400000): the program stored a pointer the backend chose.  Anything else is reported as unexplained.",
